# ═══ demo: the kn9t arcade — four plugins, one live UI rewrite, one game ══════
# Run: scripts/kn9t-demo-rec scripts/demos/build-arcade.seq
# (model script built from scripts/demos/assets/*.py by build-arcade-model.py)
#
# Story: the agent writes four plugins — pm (loads plugins through the
# `plugin_load` host-op, answering "do I really need curl?"), dice (a roll
# tool), theme (recolors the TUI by writing its Lua — hot-reloaded live) and
# snake (a playable game registered as a plugin UI). Then it installs the
# cabinet THROUGH pm, recolors the chrome on camera, seats the game, rolls a
# die, and the recording ends with actual gameplay.

env DEMO_ASK=1
env DEMO_PACE_MS=55
model-script build-arcade.model.json

rate 25
pause 1.5
say kn9t
pause 5.0                                          # boot + welcome
say Build me an arcade: write pm.py (a load_plugin tool that calls the plugin_load host-op), dice.py (a roll tool), theme.py (recolor/uncolor writing ~/.kn9t/tui/89_brand.lua) and snake.py (Snake as a plugin UI with ui_register_lua). Bootstrap pm with one curl, install the rest through its tool, recolor the UI cyan and seat the game.
pause 5.0                                          # T1: write pm.py → APPROVAL
key y                                              # Allow (not Always: that persists to
                                                   # config.toml and the reload would reap
                                                   # the provider plugin mid-prompt)
pause 7.0                                          # T2: dice/theme/snake land (3 cards)
pause 6.0                                          # T3: curl bootstraps pm
pause 6.0                                          # T4: load_plugin ×3 — registry rebuilds
pause 8.0                                          # T5: UI turns cyan + the board appears
pause 5.5                                          # T6: roll d20
pause 5.5                                          # T7: closing words
click 60 45                                        # focus the game (bottom slot)
pause 0.8
key Right
pause 0.5
key Right
pause 0.4
key Down
pause 0.5
key Down
pause 0.4
key Left
pause 0.6
key Up
pause 0.8
click 30 34                                        # tool card: expand the roll output
pause 2.5
click 30 34                                        # collapse
pause 1.2
key ctrl+q                                         # quit on a high note
